{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n第一季女神葉蒨文（Sophie）驚喜回歸TVB節目《女神配對計劃 2》，瞬間成為全場焦點！當Ice與郭珮文（阿Ju）因「邊界感」問題陷入僵局時，Sophie憑藉超強的溝通技巧及高情商，化身「戀愛導師」溫柔點醒Ice，其流利動聽的普通話更令網民為之驚艷，大讚她絕對是做主持的好材料！\n</p>\n<h2>Sophie溫柔提醒Ice注意邊界感 展現超強溝通力</h2>\n<p>在最新一集中，眼見Ice因替Yvette按摩而令女友阿Ju感到不舒服，擔任小組組長的Sophie並無直接指責，反而選擇以溫和的方式與Ice溝通。她細心地轉用普通話與Ice交流，以免對方感到尷尬，並點出問題核心：「我剛看到 Yvette 在玩時，你有一直跟她按摩嘛，每個人程度不一樣，但在我看來，感覺蠻多女生會在意的。」她更進一步引導Ice換位思考：「Ju 其實是內心挺細膩的人，我覺得她會介意。」整段對話有理有據，既給足對方情面，又清晰表達了觀點，展現出極佳的引導能力和同理心，成功化解潛在衝突。</p>\n<h2>網民洗版式激讚Sophie 封佢做主持好材料</h2>\n<p>Sophie在節目中的亮眼表現，引來網民排山倒海式的好評，不少觀眾都對她刮目相看，認為她全方位引領著組員。留言紛紛大讚：「有啲意外佢 lead 得到」、「幾好呀，用外人角度引導吓，幫觀眾問問題」、「溝通同表達能力勁到癲，引人講嘢好勁」。更有網民留意到她的語言天份和應對技巧，認為她潛力無限：「Sophie 有互動 followup，帶到講嘢」、「Sophie 問得好好，談吐好大體，講普通話好流利」，一致認為她是擔當主持的絕佳人選。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_20556578436ae805eb4a4b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_20556578436ae805eb4a4b2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_17487248586ae805ee46f60.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_17487248586ae805ee46f60.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2437667696ae805f0dbaf4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_2437667696ae805f0dbaf4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15161429026ae805f53ac45.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_15161429026ae805f53ac45.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T05:20:29.411749+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":914,"images":4,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T05:00:40+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T07:38:43.994885+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T05:18:10.223003+00:00","content_hash":"cca4b713456dba5ac0538f4368848a1e9b2a3682c1cf490e33ecb1f48d5343fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}